#: ../../source/troubleshooting/ascend_910b_operators.rst:27
msgid ""
"The missing custom GDN/Mamba operator environment caused a fallback to the built-in "
"CANN operator, which rejected the model's float32 state in this case."
msgstr ""
"A ausência do ambiente dos operadores GDN/Mamba personalizados provocou o uso do "
"operador CANN integrado, que rejeitou o estado float32 do modelo neste caso."

#. Machine-translated prose; technical literals preserved. Navigation and selected
